  "priorExpiration": "2005-03-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 702.03 Submitting the Application.\n\n(a) The application shall be submitted to the:\n\nOffice of the Commissioner, Department of Safety\n\nJames H. Hayes Building\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03305.\n\n(b) If an application is found to be incomplete, the railroad shall be notified in writing within 30 days of the date the application is received by the department.\n\nSource. #2281, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2790, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5067, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6456, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRED: 6-21-97; ss by #6473, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8776, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10889, eff 7-16-15",
